section.p:
Enable Add Ignore HTTP-4xx/5xx assertion in the recorder to attach the same ignore-error assertion used by HAR import
when a captured response has a 4xx or 5xx status. HTTP error responses are kept as enabled samplers;
connection and transport failures are reviewed separately. This option is off by default.

The sampler still runs, along with its post-processors and assertions. Ignored results are excluded
from listeners and the transaction's sample count, bytes, latency, connect time and failure status,
using the same behavior as prev.setIgnore().
